## 49, trying 2 years with her husband, 1 failed IVF round last year, hasn't decided what's next, asks what coaching would work on, then how to start

Lead: hi sonia. i'm 49, we've been trying 2 years and had one round of ivf last year that didn't work. would your program help me?

Sonia: I'm so sorry. A round that doesn't work after 2 years of trying is a lot to carry.

What feels hardest right now?

Lead: honestly we don't know what's next. what would you actually work on with me?

Sonia: Whatever you decide, I'd use my method, DETOX, NOURISH and FLOW: what in your days may be getting in the way, what your body needs, and a way of living you can keep up. If you worked with me directly in my Full program, you'd bring me what's happening between our private sessions and by text, and I'd help you adjust as you go. None of that needs a decision about treatment to be worth doing.

Lead: ok. how would i actually start?

Sonia: Thank you for sharing this with me ♡ We'll take a closer look so we can give you a thoughtful, personal response.
